<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 403 0 R/T(In addition to virtual mentorship, we host introductory robotics workshops that focus on curiosity, creativity, and learning rather than competition. These sessions help students build foundational knowledge of robotics and engineering while developing confidence in their abilities. Through our international outreach efforts, we aim to create pathways for underprivileged students to explore STEM and become more aware of opportunities available through programs like FTC.)/E(In addition to virtual mentorship, we host introductory robotics workshops that focus on curiosity, creativity, and learning rather than competition. These sessions help students build foundational knowledge of robotics and engineering while developing confidence in their abilities. Through our international outreach efforts, we aim to create pathways for underprivileged students to explore STEM and become more aware of opportunities available through programs like FTC.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[23]>>
endobj

512 0 obj
