<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 403 0 R/E(Ten middle school students participated in our three-week CAD workshop, where they gained hands-on experience in computer-aided design using platforms such as Fusion 360, AutoCAD, and TinkerCAD. Throughout the program, students learned how to create 2D sketches, develop 3D models, and understand the fundamentals of engineering design. By the end of the workshop, participants were able to design their own original components, apply measurements and constraints accurately, and think critically about how digital designs translate into real-world structures.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[48]>>
endobj

