555 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 404 0 R/E(Hands-on interaction is a key part of our outreach efforts. Rather than having students only observe, we encourage them to actively explore STEM through direct interaction with our robot. At the Cerritos Science & Art Expo, students were able to participate in activities that allowed them to learn by doing, which helped strengthen their curiosity and confidence in STEM.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

