559 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 404 0 R/E(Our team actively promotes STEM in our local community by hosting robot demonstrations, interactive workshops, and public STEM events. We focus on making robotics approachable and engaging for students of all ages, especially those who may not have prior exposure to engineering. Through hands-on interaction and real-world applications, we show that STEM is accessible, creative, and impactful.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

560 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 404 0 R/Pg 12 0 R/A[1615 0 R 0]/K[16]>>
endobj

561 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 404 0 R/E(We prioritize interactive learning over passive observation. At events like the Cerritos Science & Art Expo, students engage directly with our robot, participate in demonstrations, and ask questions about how robotics works. By allowing students to learn through experience, we help build confidence, curiosity, and long-term interest in engineering. By demonstrating how robotics addresses meaningful challenges, students begin to see STEM as more than a subject\204they see it as a tool for change.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

562 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H5/P 404 0 R/T(1st Annual CSK STEM Festival)/E(1st Annual CSK STEM Festival)/Pg 12 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

563 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 404 0 R/E(In addition, our team hosted the first annual CSK STEM Festival to further expand STEM access in our community. We organized this event with a variety of different STEM-oriented organizations to give children the opportunity to explore many fields of STEM in one place. The festival created an engaging and inclusive learning environment and reached over 200 community members, helping promote long-term interest in STEM education.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[19]>>
endobj

