571 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 404 0 R/E(Many students in our community have limited exposure to robotics and engineering careers. To address this gap, our team brings accessible, hands-on STEM activities directly to local schools and public spaces. Students experiment with real robot components, test simple coding logic, and explore how sensors and motors work together. We intentionally design activities that are beginner-friendly while still challenging. Whether a student is completely new to STEM or already curious about robotics, they leave with a stronger understanding of how engineering solves real-world problems.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[27]>>
endobj

572 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 404 0 R/E(To expand participation beyond single events, our team launched a focused STEM awareness campaign across the community. We designed informational flyers, shared digital announcements, and partnered with local schools and libraries to promote upcoming robotics workshops and demonstrations. By increasing visibility, we reached families who may not typically seek out STEM programs, boosting attendance and introducing new students to accessible engineering opportunities.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[28]>>
endobj

