590 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 405 0 R/E(Over multiple seasons in FIRST programs, we have developed strong technical and leadership skills through designing, building, programming, and iterating competitive robots. As student leaders, we have learned how to manage projects, mentor younger members, communicate with judges and sponsors, and solve real engineering problems under time pressure. However, our growth is not just for our own success. We are committed to sharing our knowledge to expand access to STEM in our community and beyond by mentoring new teams, hosting workshops, supporting FLL and FTC programs, and guiding students through CAD, programming, and outreach planning. By empowering others with the skills and confidence to participate, we aim to create lasting growth in FIRST and inspire the next generation of innovators.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

