596 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 405 0 R/E(We created an FTC OpenCV website to support the teams we mentor with computer vision development. Through our experience in FIRST Tech Challenge, we realized that many newer teams struggle with vision pipelines, camera calibration, contour detection, and integrating OpenCV into autonomous code. To make this easier, we built a structured online resource that explains key concepts in simple steps, includes example code snippets, troubleshooting tips, and visual diagrams, and walks teams through setting up and testing their pipelines. By turning our trial-and-error experience into clear documentation, we help other teams save time, avoid common mistakes, and confidently implement vision systems into their robots.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[21]>>
endobj

