710 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 407 0 R/E(Our tilt mechanism uses a slider mounted on an MGN linear rail, actuated by an over-centering linkage. This over-centering design allows the robot to remain securely tilted even after the program ends and the servos lose power at the conclusion of the match. To further improve robustness, we added omni wheels to the bottom of the tilt assembly. This addition allows the robot to maintain mobility and drive while tilted, while also preventing damage to the field tiles.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[26]>>
endobj

