986 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 411 0 R/E(PRIME is our structured engineering design process that guides how we approach building and improving our robot. It stands for Problem, Research, Ideate, Make, and Evaluate. This framework helps us think critically, stay organized, and make decisions based on strategy rather than impulse. Instead of jumping straight into building, we follow a clear sequence that encourages planning, analysis, and iteration. PRIME ensures that every subsystem on our robot is intentional and aligned with our game strategy. By continuously cycling through this process, we maintain consistency, adaptability, and steady improvement throughout the entire FTC season.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[51]>>
endobj

987 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 411 0 R/E(Design/Innovate)/Pg 19 0 R/K[52]>>
