1005 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 412 0 R/T(After deployment, we stress tested ARC-CV under varied lighting and field layouts to improve consistency. We optimized filtering, reduced latency, and fused tag pose data with odometry for precise autonomous alignment.)/E(After deployment, we stress tested ARC-CV under varied lighting and field layouts to improve consistency. We optimized filtering, reduced latency, and fused tag pose data with odometry for precise autonomous alignment.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

1006 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/P 412 0 R/T(ARC-CV uses AprilTag pose for driver-assist aiming, analyzes simulated ball trajectories for path errors, and adjusts shooter angle/velocity based on confidence and miss distances. All overlays marked prototype/simulated.)/E(ARC-CV uses AprilTag pose for driver-assist aiming, analyzes simulated ball trajectories for path errors, and adjusts shooter angle/velocity based on confidence and miss distances. All overlays marked prototype/simulated.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

1007 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 412 0 R/T(Iterative Testing and Validation We validated ARC-CV through controlled lighting tests, autonomous repetition trials, and empirical shooter calibration. By logging detection confidence, latency, and miss distances, we refined polynomial fits and trajectory adjustments to reduce drift and increase scoring consistency under variable field conditions.)/E(Iterative Testing and Validation We validated ARC-CV through controlled lighting tests, autonomous repetition trials, and empirical shooter calibration. By logging detection confidence, latency, and miss distances, we refined polynomial fits and trajectory adjustments to reduce drift and increase scoring consistency under variable field conditions.)/Pg 20 0 R/K[19]>>
endobj

