1148 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 415 0 R/E(To help attracting partners, our team developed a comprehensive sponsorship package, using a structured list to determine specific perks for our supporters. From digital recognition on our website to prominent logo logo placement on our competition robot and team apparel, incentives ensure that our sponsors have a clear vision of the tangible benefits they receive. By providing transparency to our sponsors they can choose a level of support best aligns with their goals while directly fueling our technical innovation and community outreach.)/Pg 23 0 R/K[37]>>
