<</Title(Pinpoint fuses two-wheel odometry with pre-calibrated IMU \(0.002% heading accuracy\), matching three-wheel precision with two-wheel simplicity. We used Desmos to plot empirical RPM/hood angle vs. distance data, fitting polynomial equations for real-time shooter control.)/Dest[20 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2457 0 R/Prev 2482 0 R/First 2535 0 R/Last 2535 0 R/Count -1/Next 2483 0 R>>
endobj

