2600 0 obj
<</Title(In addition to virtual mentorship, we host introductory robotics workshops that focus on curiosity, creativity, and learning rather than competition. These sessions help students build foundational knowledge of robotics and engineering while developing confidence in their abilities. Through our international outreach efforts, we aim to create pathways for underprivileged students to explore STEM and become more aware of opportunities available through programs like FTC.)/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2575 0 R/Next 2601 0 R>>
endobj

2601 0 obj
<</Title(We connect students from different regions to work on shared engineering challenges. Through breakout discussions and collaborative design tasks, students learn teamwork, idea exchange, and structured brainstorming. This builds leadership and collaboration skills while exposing them to diverse perspectives and problem-solving approaches. STEM becomes not just technical training, but a platform for teamwork and communication.)/Dest[11 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2575 0 R/Prev 2600 0 R>>
endobj

